    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH THE MUTANT WITHIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the vibrant, bio-cyberpunk world of Diamond Core Metropolis, where chaos reigns in every arena. Take control of a powerful mutant, master unique abilities, and fight for survival in an electrifying dystopian future. <br><br>Embark on the 14 chapters of the <strong>Singleplayer Story Mode</strong> or dominate the thrilling <strong>5v5 Online Multiplayer</strong> modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/9c5dd9f574ca8dd6d25817213de6b3ec.poster.avif?t=1751352831\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/9c5dd9f574ca8dd6d25817213de6b3ec.webm?t=1751352831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/9c5dd9f574ca8dd6d25817213de6b3ec.mp4?t=1751352831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BIO-CYBERPUNK WORLD OF HOVERGREASE 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of HoverGrease is a bio-cyberpunk dystopian future Earth, where mankind has unlocked many of the secrets of the human genome.\u00a0 It\u2019s a place over-saturated with AI, cybernetic enhancements, and biotechnology. Mutations are rare, but not uncommon.<br><br>Fight in the Downtown streets of Pine Bay, blast your enemies off the platforms of the Skyrise District, and survive the waves of attacks from the shores of Razer beach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/2f9d7a4a30c753de816e56d98ee67321.poster.avif?t=1751352831\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/2f9d7a4a30c753de816e56d98ee67321.webm?t=1751352831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/2f9d7a4a30c753de816e56d98ee67321.mp4?t=1751352831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND THE MUTANT FOR YOUR PLAY STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from <strong>10 mutants</strong> with over <strong>180 weapons and attacks</strong>, and blast your way to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/523c4fd72c412fc9fb324652f27d8035.avif?t=1751352831\" width=650 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with Kimmy Frog for rockets, Madeye Bull or Piggy for melee dash-and-slash, snipe your enemy with Scarlet and Billy Bo, or support the team with Labrat Perry and Peanut Piper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/f08bd47dc6c2100975a5ca7d3fead0b5.poster.avif?t=1751352831\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/f08bd47dc6c2100975a5ca7d3fead0b5.webm?t=1751352831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/f08bd47dc6c2100975a5ca7d3fead0b5.mp4?t=1751352831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EASY TO PICK UP, HARD TO MASTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HoverGrease 2 is incredibly easy to pick up.<br><br>Despite its top-down perspective widely associated with MOBAs, HoverGrease 2 plays more like a shooter (WASD+mouse or twin-stick gamepad). Skills are more important than \u2018builds\u2019, but strategy and teamwork trump both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/44afdb2c4ec1f291adc328c4deb43f21.avif?t=1751352831\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE PLAYER STORY &amp; MULTIPLAYER GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of HoverGrease 2 and play the <i>story mode</i>. Then join your friends online in a <i>team-based multiplayer online</i> game that will challenge your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer story of 14 chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique mutants to pick from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >180 unique weapons/attacks (18 for each mutant)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 maps for multiplayer game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special arcade 1v1 maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Pass for online gamemodes and unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins, achievement awards and in-game badges (cosmetics only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pay-to-win, all heroes and weapons available when you buy the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way! Mouse &amp; Keyboard, Gamepad, or  Steam Deck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/f99316961c3079f0570915e6d930b13f.avif?t=1751352831\" data-has-big width=800 height=638 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/0f867ebcaeccde8cefc67870db46457b.avif?t=1751352831\" width=650 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH THE MUTANT WITHIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the vibrant, bio-cyberpunk world of Diamond Core Metropolis, where chaos reigns in every arena. Take control of a powerful mutant, master unique abilities, and fight for survival in an electrifying dystopian future. <br><br>Embark on the 14 chapters of the <strong>Singleplayer Story Mode</strong> or dominate the thrilling <strong>5v5 Online Multiplayer</strong> modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/9c5dd9f574ca8dd6d25817213de6b3ec.poster.avif?t=1751352831\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/9c5dd9f574ca8dd6d25817213de6b3ec.webm?t=1751352831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/9c5dd9f574ca8dd6d25817213de6b3ec.mp4?t=1751352831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BIO-CYBERPUNK WORLD OF HOVERGREASE 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of HoverGrease is a bio-cyberpunk dystopian future Earth, where mankind has unlocked many of the secrets of the human genome.\u00a0 It\u2019s a place over-saturated with AI, cybernetic enhancements, and biotechnology. Mutations are rare, but not uncommon.<br><br>Fight in the Downtown streets of Pine Bay, blast your enemies off the platforms of the Skyrise District, and survive the waves of attacks from the shores of Razer beach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/2f9d7a4a30c753de816e56d98ee67321.poster.avif?t=1751352831\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam