ork trump both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/44afdb2c4ec1f291adc328c4deb43f21.avif?t=1751352831\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE PLAYER STORY &amp; MULTIPLAYER GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of HoverGrease 2 and play the <i>story mode</i>. Then join your friends online in a <i>team-based multiplayer online</i> game that will challenge your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer story of 14 chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique mutants to pick from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >180 unique weapons/attacks (18 for each mutant)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 maps for multiplayer game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special arcade 1v1 maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Pass for online gamemodes and unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins, achievement awards and in-game badges (cosmetics only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pay-to-win, all heroes and weapons available when you buy the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way! Mouse &amp; Keyboard, Gamepad, or  Steam Deck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/f99316961c3079f0570915e6d930b13f.avif?t=1751352831\" data-has-big width=800 height=638 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/0f867ebcaeccde8cefc67870db46457b.avif?t=1751352831\" width=650 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
